From: Demo Solution Team <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] sm: preserve real teardown failures and normalize confirmed absence

Only confirmed missing container state is idempotent. Preserve errno
and managed ownership on real errors; verify the actual crun adapter.
Empty unmounted namespace placeholders and absent veth cleanup remain
idempotent. Do not hide permission, I/O or internal-file failures.

Upstream-Status: Pending [native regression proof; mainline migration]
Base: aos_core_cpp 9d613a46df3c7f550062e2f19ae3406c57715694

